
    Messanger App for personal usage: 
                    P to P messanger for texting to your parents.


        Build on wxWdigets framework.

    main.cpp    - defualt main for wxWdigets.  ---> main.exe
    MyFrame.cpp - main container/linking class from wxWdigets. Entry point.
    UI.h        - UI elements.
    Server.h    - server class. Logic of the app.
    ServerThread.h - Class for managing distinct Thread for Server. (not done yet)
///
    MySocket.h  - Old simple vide-coded sokecket connection for learning.
///
    client.cpp  - Simple standalone prog for testing Server connection. ---> client.exe



